---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { PREVIEW_IDS } from "../../../../schemas/playground.mjs";
import { withBase } from "../../lib/base";
---
<SiteLayout title="Component workbench" description="Live controls and bounded inspection tools for maintained j3w1 specimens." revision>
  <p>Open a component to inspect its declared states, profile, density, text, real viewport widths, anatomy, contrast, and maintained motion. Configuration links identify the supplying build and report unavailable snapshots honestly.</p>
  <div class="site-cards">
    {PREVIEW_IDS.map((id) => <a class="card card-link" href={withBase(`workbench/${id}/`)}><span class="card-title">{id} →</span></a>)}
  </div>
  <p>Normative rules remain in the <a class="link" href={withBase("reference/")}>complete static specification</a>. Workbench behavior is a reference implementation for these specimens; standalone recipes continue to declare their own behavior dependencies.</p>
</SiteLayout>
